# Merch From – Cost Simulation Document

## 📊 Scenario Overview

**Platform:** Merch From – AI-powered conversational commerce for creators

**Scale Simulated:**
- 100 shops
- 20 products per shop
- 1,000 customers per shop/month
- 100 products sold per shop/month
- 10 conversational (AI/TTS) interactions per product creation
- 100 additional management interactions per shop/month
- 95% of AI interactions use cheapest models; 5% use advanced models (e.g., GPT-4)
- All interactions include TTS/Speech-to-Text

**Infrastructure Stack:**
- Bubble.io
- Algolia
- OpenAI
- OpenRouter.ai
- Supabase
- Vercel
- Fabric.js

