## 💡 Notes & Optimization Tips

- **Algolia:** Costs scale with search volume; enterprise deals may reduce price at scale
- **Bubble.io:** Workload units can be optimized by batching and caching
- **AI:** Use OpenRouter.ai or similar for the majority of simple tasks to minimize costs
- **Supabase/Vercel:** Costs are predictable at this scale; monitor for spikes as you grow
- **Profitability:** Even with aggressive usage, operational costs represent less than 2% of projected revenue

